			"date": "2015-01-26T13:07:43.000Z",
			"content": "<a class=\"h-cite u-bookmark-of\" href=\"http://www.zachleat.com/web/foft/\"><img class=\"u-photo\" src=\"https://awfulwoman.com/bookmarks/2015/01/26/abjmcvqg/card.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\" />\n  <span class=\"p-name\">Flash of Faux Text—still more on Font Loading—zachleat.com</span>\n  <span class=\"p-publication\">Zach Leatherman</span>\n  <span class=\"p-summary\">A post by Zach Leatherman (zachleat)</span>\n</a>\n    \n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n    <p><a href=\"http://www.zachleat.com/web/foft/\">Read Zach Leatherman on Zach Leatherman</a><span class=\"u-remove\"> and </span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/http://www.zachleat.com/web/foft/\">Archived copy</a></p>",
